1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 507088657, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1795823849, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e29", "type": "text", "x": 16, "y": 712, "width": 629.2, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 708506837, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1469118511, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2. Cómo se omiten los duplicados: tres capas", "originalText": "2. Cómo se omiten los duplicados: tres capas", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 23, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e30", "type": "text", "x": 16, "y": 748, "width": 1122.0, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 652768598, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2100080515, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Las dos primeras las resuelve el sistema solo; la tercera la confirma una persona. Lo implementa Python; el frontend muestra el mensaje.", "originalText": "Las dos primeras las resuelve el sistema solo; la tercera la confirma una persona. Lo implementa Python; el frontend muestra el mensaje.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 13, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e31", "type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 810, "width": 600, "height": 380, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1811180650, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 168393880, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e32", "type": "text", "x": 42, "y": 820, "width": 209.00000000000003, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 333377415, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1347535309, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1  EL MISMO ARCHIVO", "originalText": "1  EL MISMO ARCHIVO", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 18, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e33", "type": "text", "x": 42, "y": 851.0, "width": 379.50000000000006, "height": 225.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1460814403, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1504004732, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "rosa.xlsx  y  reporte_final_2.xlsx\n  → \"Este archivo ya se cargó el 21 nov\n     como 'rosa.xlsx'. No se vuelve a cargar.\"\n\nVuelto a guardar, columnas en otro orden\no exportado a CSV\n  → \"Mismo contenido que 'rosa.xlsx'.\n     No hay nada nuevo.\"\n\nCómo: huella de los bytes, y huella\ndel contenido (filas normalizadas\ny ordenadas)", "originalText": "rosa.xlsx  y  reporte_final_2.xlsx\n  → \"Este archivo ya se cargó el 21 nov\n     como 'rosa.xlsx'. No se vuelve a cargar.\"\n\nVuelto a guardar, columnas en otro orden\no exportado a CSV\n  → \"Mismo contenido que 'rosa.xlsx'.\n     No hay nada nuevo.\"\n\nCómo: huella de los bytes, y huella\ndel contenido (filas normalizadas\ny ordenadas)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 13, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e34", "type": "rectangle", "x": 650, "y": 810, "width": 600, "height": 380, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2133201996, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1959386987, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e35", "type": "text", "x": 662, "y": 820, "width": 176.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 295334610, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 401991736, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2  LA MISMA FILA", "originalText": "2  LA MISMA FILA", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 18, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e36", "type": "text", "x": 662, "y": 851.0, "width": 354.75000000000006, "height": 243.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1159380354, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2036236842, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "rosa_v2.xlsx = lo de antes + 8 filas\n  → \"Parece una versión nueva: 122 filas\n     ya estaban y se omiten; se agregan 8.\"\n\nnutricion.xlsx comparte 30 filas\n  → \"Comparte 30 filas con 'rosa.xlsx'.\n     Se cuentan una sola vez.\"\n\nPresidencia puede restituir una fila con\n\"Contar de todos modos\" (queda en bitácora)\n\nCómo: una huella por fila que no depende\ndel archivo", "originalText": "rosa_v2.xlsx = lo de antes + 8 filas\n  → \"Parece una versión nueva: 122 filas\n     ya estaban y se omiten; se agregan 8.\"\n\nnutricion.xlsx comparte 30 filas\n  → \"Comparte 30 filas con 'rosa.xlsx'.\n     Se cuentan una sola vez.\"\n\nPresidencia puede restituir una fila con\n\"Contar de todos modos\" (queda en bitácora)\n\nCómo: una huella por fila que no depende\ndel archivo", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 13, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e37", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1270, "y": 810, "width": 600, "height": 380, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 279172787, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 260573196, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e38", "type": "text", "x": 1282, "y": 820, "width": 209.00000000000003, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1329753548, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1914012529, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3  LA MISMA PERSONA", "originalText": "3  LA MISMA PERSONA", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 18, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e39", "type": "text", "x": 1282, "y": 851.0, "width": 354.75000000000006, "height": 225.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1222328496, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1656961616, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Mismo ID de EIRA y mismo nombre\n  → una persona, sin preguntar\n\nMismo ID y nombre distinto\n  → \"¿Es la misma persona escrita distinto,\n     o son dos personas con el mismo ID?\"\n     Decide una persona; hasta entonces\n     cuentan como una.\n\nID de EIRA = iniciales + fecha de\nnacimiento (AAAAMMDD). Puede chocar:\nEIRA ya lo sabe y lo quiere ver.", "originalText": "Mismo ID de EIRA y mismo nombre\n  → una persona, sin preguntar\n\nMismo ID y nombre distinto\n  → \"¿Es la misma persona escrita distinto,\n     o son dos personas con el mismo ID?\"\n     Decide una persona; hasta entonces\n     cuentan como una.\n\nID de EIRA = iniciales + fecha de\nnacimiento (AAAAMMDD). Puede chocar:\nEIRA ya lo sabe y lo quiere ver.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 13, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e40", "type": "rectangle", "x": 0, "y": 1280, "width": 1900, "height": 700, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#adb5bd", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1490376254, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 96907016, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e41", "type": "text", "x": 16, "y": 1292, "width": 371.8, "height": 32.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1982966163, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1526706730, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3. Cómo se vería (bocetos)", "originalText": "3. Cómo se vería (bocetos)", "fontSize": 26, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 23, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e42", "type": "text", "x": 16, "y": 1328, "width": 1146.75, "height": 18.75, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 721762279, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 502922617, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Cabecera con los cuatro pasos. Español, letra de 16 px o más, estados con texto además de color. Las capturas reales van en docs/capturas/.", "originalText": "Cabecera con los cuatro pasos. Español, letra de 16 px o más, estados con texto además de color. Las capturas reales van en docs/capturas/.", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 13, "autoResize": true}, {"id": "e43", "type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 1380, "width": 600, "height": 280, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffffff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 2120395275, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 253207297, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e44", "type": "rectangle", "x": 30, "y": 1